      "block_type": 0
    },
    {
      "block_id": "2605.06070_p6_b24",
      "text": "For each instance, the estimated QD\u2217is treated as a fine-grained reward signal, enabling DPO to\nlearn more fine-grained preferences. Specifically, instead of only using the ordering between the\nchosen and rejected responses, we incorporate QD\u2217as a instance-specific margin that potentially\nreflects the preference intensity. The resulting BT model with a margin is formulated as follows:\n",
