    {
      "block_id": "2605.06070_p6_b44",
      "text": "where \u03b3 is a coefficient to align the scale of QD\u2217with \u03b4\u03b8. Compared to standard DPO, which only\nenforces a positive ordering between image pairs, ArenaPO further encourages the policy to match\nthe magnitude of the preference gap. As a result, the model not only learns which response is better,\nbut also how much better it is, thus achieving more fine-grained and effective preference optimization.\n",
