    {
      "block_id": "2605.06070_p6_b47",
      "text": "Models and Datasets We perform preference optimization training on Stable Diffusion 1.5 [27]\nand Stable Diffusion XL [24]. In addition to the commonly used Pick-a-Pic v2 [15] dataset, we also\nperform training on the recent HPD v3 [22] dataset, which includes a more diverse set of models and\ncan further leverage the strengths of Arena.\n",
      "bbox": [
        108.0,
