      "block_type": 0
    },
    {
      "block_id": "2605.06070_p6_b48",
      "text": "Baseline Methods We thoroughly compare ArenaPO with existing representative baseline methods\nfor diffusion preference optimization, including Diffusion-DPO [35], MaPO [11], DSPO [42], and\nSDPO [9]. Notably, all results reported on the HPD v3 dataset are reproduced using the official\nopen-source implementations with the original hyperparameters.\n",
      "bbox": [
