    },
    {
      "block_id": "2605.06070_p6_b49",
      "text": "Evaluations We adopt multiple preference metrics to verify the performance of trained models,\nincluding PickScore [15], HPS v2 [36], Aesthetic [28], CLIP [25], and ImageReward [37], where\nthe prompts are from Pick-a-Pic v2 [15], HPS v2 [36], and PartiPrompts [40], respectively. We also\nconduct evaluations on the recent human preference alignment benchmark K-Sort Eval [18].\n",
      "bbox": [
